&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Meet Ozow&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ozow&amp;nbsp;is a leading fintech company&amp;nbsp;that’s&amp;nbsp;redefining digital payments in South Africa and beyond.&amp;nbsp;We’re&amp;nbsp;dedicated to making payments more accessible, secure, and convenient for both businesses and consumers. As a fast-growing player in the financial technology sector,&amp;nbsp;Ozow&amp;nbsp;fosters a culture of innovation, diversity, and inclusivity. We believe in pushing the boundaries of&amp;nbsp;what’s&amp;nbsp;possible and are committed to making a positive impact on the world through our payment solutions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More about this Ozow fantastic position&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are&amp;nbsp;seeking&amp;nbsp;a commercially driven and technically fluent Enterprise Solutions Lead to lead how&amp;nbsp;Ozow&amp;nbsp;designs, sells and delivers payment solutions across our entire merchant base.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a growth role. It owns the way we approach both existing merchants and prospective merchants, turning&amp;nbsp;Ozow’s&amp;nbsp;product capability and payment rails into solutions that win new business, deepen and&amp;nbsp;retain&amp;nbsp;the merchants we already serve, and open new revenue&amp;nbsp;streams. It brings together commercial,&amp;nbsp;product&amp;nbsp;and partnership thinking in one place.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bank and partner relationships are central to this role. They are the building blocks from which our solutions are made, and this role owns developing them with that purpose in mind. The individual will work closely with the CEO, Growth and Commercial, Product and Engineering teams, and will build and lead a team over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Merchant Solutions Strategy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own how&amp;nbsp;Ozow&amp;nbsp;approaches its merchant base, shaping a more deliberate and differentiated way of engaging both existing and prospective merchants.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the solution proposition across the base, from repeatable solutions that scale to bespoke solutions for larger and more complex merchants.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritise&amp;nbsp;where solution effort is focused to create the greatest commercial value.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Solution Design &amp;amp; Delivery&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate merchant needs into clear commercial and technical solutions, from first engagement through to a signed, deliverable outcome.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product and Engineering to move solutions from design into delivery, and to package successful solutions for reuse.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring together the commercial case, including the commercial and financial model,&amp;nbsp;and the technical design so that what is sold is what can be delivered.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bank Partnership Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage the bank,&amp;nbsp;infrastructure&amp;nbsp;and partner relationships that serve as the building blocks for&amp;nbsp;Ozow’s&amp;nbsp;solutions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-develop capability&amp;nbsp;and commercial&amp;nbsp;dealswith&amp;nbsp;partners&amp;nbsp;where&amp;nbsp;doing so unlocks value for merchants and differentiates&amp;nbsp;Ozow’s&amp;nbsp;offering.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent&amp;nbsp;Ozow&amp;nbsp;credibly with senior partner and bank stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Revenue Growth &amp;amp; Retention&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow revenue across both new and existing merchants,&amp;nbsp;drive the&amp;nbsp;acquisition of enterprise and complex merchants&amp;nbsp;through outreach,&amp;nbsp;networks&amp;nbsp;and business development.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deepen integration and relationships within the existing base to grow revenue per merchant and strengthen retention.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be accountable for defined revenue and retention outcomes for the function.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Cross-Functional &amp;amp; Team Leadership &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Sales, Product and Engineering to align the go-to-market approach for key merchants.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed merchant and&amp;nbsp;partner&amp;nbsp;insight back into product direction, so the roadmap is shaped by real, paying demand.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and lead the solutions function, developing the team, ways of working and playbooks over time, and delivering against function OKRs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are an ideal candidate if you have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a commercial,&amp;nbsp;technical&amp;nbsp;or related field (post-graduate qualification an advantage).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in payments,&amp;nbsp;fintech&amp;nbsp;or enterprise technology, across solutions, commercial or partnerships roles.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven&amp;nbsp;track record&amp;nbsp;of designing and selling solutions to large or complex merchants or clients.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and managing bank,&amp;nbsp;platform&amp;nbsp;or partner relationships as a route to commercial outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Both commercial and technical fluency, enough to structure and price a deal and to be credible with product and engineering teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working cross-functionally and building or leading a team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong executive presence and the ability to influence senior internal and external stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly commercial, with an ownership mindset and high accountability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of the South African payments landscape an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Your skills and competencies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You eagerly embrace change, absorb cross-functional skills, and connect ideas across disciplines to drive fresh thinking and innovation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Ability to initiate, develop, maintain and leverage outstanding relationships to influence a wide network, both inside and outside the company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;A trailblazer who steps up, takes charge, and creates meaningful impact—those driven by performance and purpose to lead from the front and make a real difference every day.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You thrive in collaboration, embrace inclusion, and bring a genuine curiosity for global cultures—valuing collective success over individual credit.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Demonstrate strategic foresight, sound judgement, and the ability to make confident decisions under uncertainty, always working toward the best possible outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You challenge norms, champion innovation, and constantly seek growth—for themselves, their team, and the solutions they build.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You are a decisive doer—those who take initiative, follow through with confidence, and ensure results through courageous, hands-on leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We value optimism, agility, and the strength to persevere under pressure—balancing performance with positivity, even in challenging environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You are driven, proactive individuals who take ownership, face challenges with grit, and consistently push for excellence—not just as participants, but as catalysts for success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interview process&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;During the interview process you will meet with the People team, the hiring manager, and relevant CSuite. Our process may include psychometric and technical assessments, giving you an opportunity to demonstrate your strengths, skills and potential beyond your CV and interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In office perks&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Healthy breakfast, lunches and snacks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly team connects&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On-site Barista&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks for South African based employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical aid subsidy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Group Risk Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous paid annual leave &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Birthday leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and Development opportunities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentorship programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quarterly team building&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Community initiatives&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to cutting edge technology - &lt;a href=&quot;https://ozow.com/tech-stack&quot;&gt;Ozow Tech Stack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Employee Value Proposition&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join Ozow and become part of an elite force that challenges the ordinary and achieves the extraordinary. If you&#39;re driven to make an impact, embrace challenges, and seek unparalleled opportunities for growth, your journey starts here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentStart CommentHighlightPipeRest CommentHighlightRest SCXW7022158 BCX8&quot;&gt;As &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightPipeRest SCXW7022158 BCX8&quot;&gt;a fintech company, we prioritize data security, confidentiality, regulatory and compliance. Due to the sensitive nature of our work, we require individuals with &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW7022158 BCX8&quot;&gt;a high level&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW7022158 BCX8&quot;&gt; of integrity and trustworthiness to ensure adherence to financial regulations and industry standards. Given the sensitive nature of our work, all employees are expected to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW7022158 BCX8&quot;&gt;demonstrate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW7022158 BCX8&quot;&gt; professionalism, accountability, and a commitment to ethical conduct in line with financial regulations and industry standards&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to be exceptional?&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;Apply now!&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keen to know more?&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Interested in joining our rocket ship?&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To find out more about life at&amp;nbsp;Ozow, head over to our Careers Page &lt;a href=&quot;https://ozow.com/ozow-careers/&quot;&gt;here!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Meet Ozow&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ozow is a leading fintech company redefining digital payments in South Africa and beyond. We make payments more accessible, secure, and convenient for businesses and consumers alike. As a fast-growing player in financial technology, we foster a culture of innovation, diversity, and inclusivity, and we are committed to making a positive impact through our payment solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our Fraud Manager, you will protect Ozow, its merchants, and their customers from financial crime and fraud-related losses. Leading a high-performing fraud team, you will define and execute our fraud prevention and detection strategy across EFT, card, and emerging payment methods, using data, automation, and strong industry relationships to catch fraud early without adding friction for legitimate transactions. It is a role for someone who moves fast without losing precision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;You will work closely with the Fraud Strategy Lead on strategy, rules, risk appetite, and the fraud technology roadmap, and partner across Risk, Compliance, Legal, Commercial, FinOps, Product, Engineering, and Data.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; team&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop a high-performing Fraud Operations team, fostering accountability, innovation, and continuous improvement through coaching, regular performance reviews, and development planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own team resourcing and capacity planning, including shift scheduling, overtime, and after-hours or weekend coverage, against alert and investigation volumes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the internal fraud subject-matter expert, guiding fraud operations and controls and engaging banking partners on fraud-related matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own fraud rule design, risk appetite recommendations, and vendor relationships for the fraud function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with merchants&#39; fraud and risk teams to exchange typology intelligence and coordinate joint mitigation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fraud strategy &amp;amp; risk&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate Ozow&#39;s fraud strategy into operational execution, aligned to business growth objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously assess emerging fraud threats, trends, and attack vectors, and define and monitor the key risk indicators that inform fraud risk appetite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide fraud risk input into new products and payment methods ahead of launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with industry bodies and fraud intelligence-sharing networks to strengthen threat awareness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Detection, prevention &amp;amp; response&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reduce fraud losses across EFT, card, and other payment methods while protecting approval rates, investigating trends and patterns to identify emerging loss drivers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive fraud rule performance through continuous back-testing, tuning, and retirement of rules based on live catch-rate and false-positive results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen detection beyond rule logic, including case-management tooling, entity-level controls such as blocklists and watchlists, and monitoring and control infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify vulnerabilities and recommend preventative measures across consumer- and merchant-facing typologies, including merchant-side signals such as volume or value deviation, dormant reactivation, and scam-driven activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee investigations, root-cause analysis, and remediation, and lead incident response for fraud events across the relevant teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct regular fraud risk assessments and control-effectiveness reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Analytics, reporting &amp;amp; AI&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce actionable fraud reporting for executive stakeholders, measuring KPIs such as fraud losses, false positives, capture rates, and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse fraud data to surface structured insight and proactive-intervention opportunities beyond day-to-day rule tuning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Data and Product to improve fraud models and risk-based decision-making, applying machine-learning risk-scoring outputs to inform rule and decisioning strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate manual review and investigation workflows, and pilot and operationalise AI-driven tools, improving efficiency without compromising detection quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Regulatory compliance, governance &amp;amp; tooling&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure adherence to applicable regulatory requirements, scheme rules, and internal policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equip and train the team to identify and escalate suspicious activity and file Suspicious Activity Reports (SARs) in line with FIC Act obligations, working with Legal and Compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support audits, compliance reviews, and regulatory engagements relating to fraud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain fraud policies, procedures, reporting frameworks, and governance documentation, and drive fraud-awareness education across the organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify fraud technology and tooling needs, and lead adoption of new tools and processes, including training, change management, and stakeholder buy-in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are an ideal candidate if you have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Essential&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 to 5 years leading and developing high-performing teams in a fraud, risk, financial crime, or operations environment, including shift-based or extended-hours coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience designing and implementing fraud prevention, detection, and investigation controls in a high-growth environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record managing fraud losses, risk controls, and operational fraud performance metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering across Risk, Compliance, Legal, Commercial, FinOps, Product, Engineering, and Data to deliver fraud mitigation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing vendor or external platform relationships in a fraud, risk, or technology context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience presenting fraud trends, insights, and recommendations to senior leadership and executive stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with data-driven decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with fraud monitoring, transaction monitoring, case-management, and rule-based decisioning tools, plus BI and analytics tools such as Power BI or Looker.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Advantageous&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the South African payments regulatory environment (FIC Act, POPIA, PASA/SARB oversight).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional certifications such as CFE, CAMS, or CFCS, or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SQL and data-querying proficiency, and a working understanding of machine-learning concepts applied to fraud or risk scoring.&lt;/li&gt;
