&lt;p&gt;Interested in joining our rocket ship?&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To find out more about life at&amp;nbsp;Ozow, head over to our Careers Page &lt;a href=&quot;https://ozow.com/ozow-careers/&quot;&gt;here!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Meet Ozow&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ozow is a leading fintech company that&#39;s redefining digital payments in South Africa and beyond. We&#39;re dedicated to making payments more accessible, secure, and convenient for both businesses and consumers. As a fast-growing player in the financial technology sector, Ozow fosters a culture of innovation, diversity, and inclusivity. We believe in pushing the boundaries of what&#39;s possible and are committed to making a positive impact on the world through our payment solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More about this Ozow fantastic position&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Marketing Manager to act as the strategic counterpart to our Head of Marketing, owning the content strategy, running the operational engine of the marketing department, and managing a direct report/s. This is a genuine dual role, combining real strategic input with hands-on operational ownership, and it comes with a clear path toward a senior, department-leading position as the team and its remit continue to grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;People Management &amp;amp; Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage, coach, and develop any reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set clear expectations and provide the mentorship needed for your direct report to grow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Marketing Strategy Contribution &amp;amp; Content Ownership&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interpret and contribute materially to the broader marketing strategy, acting as a genuine strategic counterpart to the Head of Marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the content strategy end to end, with your direct report as a key contributor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the second layer of interrogation on all content before it reaches the Head of Marketing, adding research depth, technical comprehension, and insight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Departmental Operations &amp;amp; Workflow&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operationalise the marketing function, managing brief intake, studio and team workflow, and the balance between brief volume and production capacity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run stand-ups and set the standard of accountability within the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the escalation point when delivery is at risk, and resolve competing stakeholder priorities before they reach the Head of Marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Agency &amp;amp; Partner Management&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the first point of contact for external partners across the line, including the PR agency, performance agency production agency, and out-of-home&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This can also extend to merchants and partners, where you will be identifying co-marketing opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate strategy into strategic briefs, and brief these into the Content Strategist for detailed production briefs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Head of Marketing and the Product Marketing Manager in developing go-to-market strategies for products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Commercial team in client pitch scenarios&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage external agencies across more than one discipline to ensure delivery on brief, on time, and on budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess Ozow&#39;s participation in events and activations, determining the strategic rationale, the role the event plays, and the appropriate level of investment - importantly take full ownership of the marketing programme around these events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Campaign Leadership &amp;amp; Performance&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead large-scale out-of-home and digital campaigns end to end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use funnel and campaign performance data, including lead volume, conversion, transaction rates, and revenue, to assess and improve campaign impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report on performance monthly, including cost per acquisition and conversion quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tool Utilization + Change Management&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure proper utilization, or introduce and embed new work management tools to support brief intake and delivery tracking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to policy, process, and documentation to support a consistent, department-wide workflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Automation and AI&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore and apply AI tools to support content review, briefing, and workflow efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to streamline agency and production workflows through automation where relevant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are an ideal candidate if&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a relevant marketing qualification (degree or equivalent)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have proven experience owning a content strategy end to end, not just executing content calendars&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience contributing to, interpreting, and executing against a broader marketing strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience in fintech or fintech adjacent sectors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a B2B marketing background&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience managing marketing operations or departmental workflow, including brief intake and delivery management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience managing external agencies across more than one discipline, such as PR, performance, media, or production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong writing and editorial judgement, sufficient to interrogate and materially improve another person&#39;s content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have prior line management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience in a scale up or smaller, fast moving marketing team where the role is broad&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have familiarity with work management tools for brief intake and delivery tracking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have prior experience leading out of home or large scale integrated campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience running team rituals such as stand ups or sprint planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your skills and competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You eagerly embrace change, absorb cross-functional skills, and connect ideas across disciplines to drive fresh thinking and innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to initiate, develop, maintain and leverage outstanding relationships to influence a wide network, both inside and outside the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A trailblazer who steps up, takes charge, and creates meaningful impact: driven by performance and purpose to lead from the front and make a real difference every day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in collaboration, embrace inclusion, and bring a genuine curiosity for global cultures, valuing collective success over individual credit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate strategic foresight, sound judgement, and the ability to make confident decisions under uncertainty, always working toward the best possible outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You challenge norms, champion innovation, and constantly seek growth, for yourself, your team, and the solutions you build.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a decisive doer who takes initiative, follows through with confidence, and ensures results through courageous, hands-on leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
